        "body": "The number in all three sets is \\(6\\).\n\n\\[\nD\\cap R \\text{ only}=9-6=3\n\\]\n\n\\[\nC\\cap R \\text{ only}=8-6=2\n\\]\n\n\\[\nD\\cap C \\text{ only}=x-6\n\\]"
