        "title": "There are students outside all",
        "body": "There are \\(5\\) students outside all three sets. The total number of students is \\(50\\), so\n\n\\[\n(25-x)+(16-x)+9+(x-6)+3+2+6+5=50\n\\]\n\n\\[\n60-x=50\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx=10\n\\]"
