        "title": "Now find",
        "body": "Now find \\(s\\):\n\\[\ns=\\left(\\frac23\\right)^3+5\\left(\\frac23\\right)^2-8\\left(\\frac23\\right)+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\ns=\\frac{8}{27}+\\frac{20}{9}-\\frac{16}{3}+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\ns=\\frac{194}{27}\n\\]"
