        "body": "The cross-section is a trapezium with parallel sides \\(37\\) cm and \\(28\\) cm, and perpendicular height \\(20\\) cm.\n\n\\[\n\\text{Area of cross-section}=\\frac12(37+28)(20)=650\n\\]"
