        "title": "Area of triangle is",
        "body": "Area of triangle \\(CDB\\) is\n\\[\n\\frac12\\times BD\\times CB\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\text{Area}=\\frac12\\times32\\times\\sqrt{201}=226.9\\ldots\n\\]"
