        "body": "The point \\(E\\) is vertically above \\(C\\), so triangle \\(ACE\\) is right-angled at \\(C\\).\n\n\\[\n\\angle CAE=35^\\circ\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\tan35^\\circ=\\frac{CE}{AC}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nCE=40\\tan35^\\circ\n\\]"
