        "title": "Now find , the coordinate",
        "body": "Now find \\(a\\), the \\(y\\)-coordinate when \\(x=\\frac23\\):\n\n\\[\na=27\\left(\\frac23\\right)^2+\\frac{16}{\\frac23}\n\\]\n\n\\[\na=27\\cdot\\frac49+24\n\\]\n\n\\[\na=12+24=36\n\\]"
