  "expertise::May2025_4WM2HR__Q23__p26-26__m03__Algebra-Toolkit": {
    "status": "checked",
    "checkedBy": "Dr Eslam Ahmed + Codex",
    "updated": "2026-05-16T09:02:20",
    "topicNote": "",
    "steps": [
      {
        "title": "Required",
        "body": "The graph of *y* = *a*sin (*x*+*b*)<sup>∘</sup> + *c* for 0 ≤ *x* ≤ 360 is shown. Find suitable values for *a*, *b*, and *c*."
      },
      {
        "title": "Read the maximum and minimum",
        "body": "Read the maximum and minimum values from the graph to find the **amplitude** *a* and **vertical shift** *c*:\n$$a = \\\\frac{\\\\text{max}-\\\\text{min}}{2} = \\\\frac{4-(-2)}{2} = 3\n        \\\\qquad\n        c = \\\\frac{\\\\text{max}+\\\\text{min}}{2} = \\\\frac{4+(-2)}{2} = 1$$"
      },
      {
        "title": "Find the phase shift b",
        "body": "Find the **phase shift** *b*. The standard sin  has its peak at *x* = 90°. From the graph, the maximum occurs at *x* ≈ 45°:\n*x* + *b* = 90° ⟹ 45° + *b* = 90° ⟹ *b* = 45°"
      },
      {
        "title": "Verify at x 0 consistent",
        "body": "Verify at *x* = 0: $y = 4\\\\sin(0+45)° = 4\\\\times\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\approx 2.83$ — consistent with graph"
      },
      {
        "title": "Note",
        "body": "The period of the graph is still 360° (unchanged), so no horizontal stretch is applied."
      }
    ],
    "finalAnswer": "*a* = 3,*b* = 45,*c* = 1"
  },
  "expertise::May2025_4WM2HR__Q24__p27-27__m06__Algebra-Toolkit": {
    "status": "checked",
    "checkedBy": "Dr Eslam Ahmed + Codex",
    "updated": "2026-05-16T09:02:20",
    "topicNote": "",
    "steps": [
      {
        "title": "Required",
        "body": "Series P: first term *a*, c.d. *d*; *S*<sub>40</sub>(*P*) = 2070. Series Q: first term 2*a*, c.d. 3*d*; 25th term of Q  = 186. Find *S*<sub>40</sub>(*Q*)."
      },
      {
        "title": "Form equation from S 40",
        "body": "Form equation from *S*<sub>40</sub>(*P*) = 2070:\n$$S\\_{40} = \\\\frac{40}{2}\\[2a+39d\\] = 20(2a+39d) = 2070\n        \\\\implies 2a + 39d = 103.5 \\\\tag{1}$$"
      },
      {
        "title": "Form equation from 25th term",
        "body": "Form equation from 25th term of Q  = 186:\n*T*<sub>25</sub>(*Q*) = 2*a* + 24(3*d*) = 2*a* + 72*d* = 186"
      },
      {
        "title": "Solve simultaneously subtract (1) from",
        "body": "Solve simultaneously — subtract (1) from (2):\n33*d* = 82.5 ⟹ *d* = 2.5"
      },
      {
        "title": "Substitute d 2.5 into (1)",
        "body": "Substitute *d* = 2.5 into (1):\n2*a* + 39(2.5) = 103.5 ⟹ 2*a* = 6 ⟹ *a* = 3"
      },
      {
        "title": "Compute S 40 ( Q",
        "body": "Compute *S*<sub>40</sub>(*Q*), with first term  = 2*a* = 6 and c.d.  = 3*d* = 7.5:\n$$S\\_{40}(Q) = \\\\frac{40}{2}\\\\bigl\\[2(6) + 39(7.5)\\\\bigr\\]\n        = 20\\\\bigl\\[12 + 292.5\\\\bigr\\]\n        = 20 \\\\times 304.5 = 6090$$"
      }
    ],
    "finalAnswer": "*S*<sub>40</sub>(*Q*) = 6090"
  },
