        "title": "Point lies on the line",
        "body": "Point \\(A=(0.2,2.6)\\) lies on the line.\n\n\\[\n2.6=3(0.2)+e\n\\]\n\n\\[\n2.6=0.6+e\n\\]\n\n\\[\ne=2\n\\]"
